Package: beatpool
Type: Package
Title: Moment Pooling of PCA Bases for ECG Heartbeat Compression
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raydonal", "Ospina", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "raydonalmartinez@ufba.br"),
    person("Abel", "Borges", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Tools for representing, compressing and clustering ECG
    heartbeats with patient-specific principal component bases that are
    pooled across sites. The central operator pools second moments rather
    than directions: each record transmits its leading eigenpairs and the
    receiver assembles the weighted sum of rank-q moments, which is invariant
    to the eigenvector indeterminacy and optimal for the assembled moment.
    Also implements direction pooling (arithmetic mean, column-normalised
    mean, QR retraction, Procrustes mean and generalised Procrustes analysis),
    hierarchical subspace pooling, residual imputation, energy-normalised
    moments, several shared bases fitted from transmitted moments, discrete Hermite and
    cosine bases, reconstruction and clustering metrics, jackknife and
    bootstrap stability, communication accounting and simulation models.
    A pure-R reader for WFDB headers, signals and annotations is included.
